        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The Stanley Parable: Ultra Deluxe is an expanded re-imagining of 2013's The Stanley Parable. You will play as Stanley, and you will not play as Stanley. You will make a choice, and you will become powerless. You are not here to win. The Stanley Parable is a game that plays you.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "The Stanley Parable: Ultra Deluxe es una reinterpretación ampliada de The Stanley Parable de 2013. Tú interpretarás a Stanley, y no interpretarás a Stanley. Tomarás una decisión y te quedarás sin poder. No estás aquí para ganar. The Stanley Parable es un juego que te juega a ti.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
